# Godot
.godot/
*.uid
*.import
*:Zone.Identifier
config.cfg

# Ported Libre-TrainSim binary assets: present locally for the runtime but not
# redistributed in this repo (GPL asset tree, ~600MB). Curated assets live in
# assets/ (see CREDITS.md). Procedural fallbacks ship when these are absent.
Resources/*
!Resources/.gdignore

# Curated downloaded assets (add via source-controlled manifests instead)
assets/*.glb
assets/*.gltf
assets/*.hdr
assets/*.png
!assets/.gitkeep

# Ported LTS train models: present locally for the runtime but not redistributed
Trains/*
